              "p": "In Spanish: _I saw her, not him._",
              "r": "La vi a ella, no a él.",
              "nota": "Short pronoun + a ella."
            },
            {
              "p": "Fix it: _Invitamos a ellos._",
              "r": "Los invitamos a ellos. / Los invitamos.",
